OL,3,GNEWSA'Unprecedented' murder cases see
OL,4,Apolice force consider 'zero-hours'
OL,5,Adetectives
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn "unprecedented" number of murder
OL,8,Finvestigations this year could see
OL,9,FGwent Police hire detectives on
OL,10,F"zero-hour" style contracts to cope
OL,11,Fwith demand.
OL,13,FChief Constable Mark Hobrough said the
OL,14,Fforce would normally see two or three
OL,15,Fmurder probes a year, but has launched
OL,16,F11 in the past 10 months.
OL,18,FAs a result it has had to fund record
OL,19,Famounts of overtime payments and take
OL,20,Fneighbourhood officers away from
OL,21,Fcommunity policing duties to cope with
OL,22,Fthe demand.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
