OL,3,GNEWSA'Unprecedented' murder cases see
OL,4,Apolice force consider 'zero-hours'
OL,5,Adetectives
OL,6,
OL,7,FHobrough said the 1,535 officer-strong
OL,8,Fforce would use the additional
OL,9,Fdetectives if the same trend continues
OL,10,Fnext year, but did not specify where
OL,11,Fthey would come from or how the scheme
OL,12,Fwould work.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
